## Overview

HealTrack AI is a post-discharge healthcare coordination platform. Doctors create personalized recovery plans for patients. Patients track daily tasks, medicines, and vitals. Caretakers monitor progress. After an appointment is confirmed, patient and doctor can communicate in real-time through text chat and voice messages directly within the platform. The platform also includes real-time exercise posture analysis using MediaPipe Pose detection running entirely in the browser.

The core workflow is:

```
Patient searches for doctor
  -> Books appointment
    -> Doctor confirms appointment
      -> Patient and doctor communicate via chat
        -> Doctor creates recovery plan
          -> System generates daily tasks
            -> Patient completes tasks
              -> Progress updates and alerts trigger
                -> Doctor monitors and adjusts plan
```

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer              | Technology                                       |
|--------------------|--------------------------------------------------|
| Frontend           | React 19, React Router 7                         |
| Build Tool         | Vite 8                                           |
| Styling            | CSS (custom, component-scoped)                   |
| Backend            | Python Flask                                     |
| Real-Time Server   | Flask-SocketIO                                   |
| ORM                | SQLAlchemy                                       |
| Database           | SQLite                                           |
| Authentication     | JWT (flask-jwt-extended), bcrypt                 |
| Pose Detection     | MediaPipe Pose (WebAssembly, browser-side)       |
| Camera Integration | @mediapipe/camera_utils                          |
| Visualization      | @mediapipe/drawing_utils                         |
| Audio Recording    | MediaRecorder API (browser-native)               |
| Audio Playback     | HTML5 Audio API (browser-native)                 |
| Real-Time Transport| Socket.IO (WebSocket with fallback)              |
| OCR (optional)     | pytesseract, Pillow, pdf2image                   |
| ML (optional)      | scikit-learn, pandas, numpy                      |

---

## Features

### Core Features

- **Three user roles**: Patient, Doctor, Caretaker with dedicated dashboards
- **JWT authentication** with role-based access control and bcrypt password hashing
- **Doctor search and filtering** by name, specialization, and hospital
- **Appointment booking** with confirmation workflow
- **Recovery plan creation** by doctor with automatic daily task generation
- **Medicine tracking** with dosage, frequency, timing, and taken/pending/missed status
- **Health vitals tracking** with normal/abnormal detection and auto-alerts
- **Daily patient check-in** with feeling, pain, activity, sleep, temperature, BP, SpO2, symptoms
- **Recovery progress** with overall score, weekly trends, and streaks
- **Alert system** auto-generated for abnormal vitals, missed medicines, pending tasks
- **File upload** for lab reports, prescriptions, discharge summaries (PDF, JPG, PNG)
- **AI chat assistant** with rule-based contextual responses

### Real-Time Communication

- **Socket.IO real-time messaging** between patient and doctor after appointment confirmation
- **Text chat** with instant message delivery and read receipts
- **Voice messages** using browser MicroRecorder API for audio recording
- **Audio playback** with play/pause controls and duration display in chat
- **Message history** persisted in database, loadable on page refresh
- **Online status** indicator showing when doctor/patient is connected
- **Unread message count** badge on dashboard
- **Chat accessible from** patient appointments page and doctor patient detail page

### Advanced Features

- **Real-time exercise posture analysis** using MediaPipe Pose in the browser
- **33 body landmark detection** with angle calculation for joint positions
- **Form scoring** comparing detected angles against correct form thresholds
- **Rep counting** with state machine detection (top/bottom positions)
- **Exercise history and trend tracking** visible to doctor
- **Supported exercises** — squats, push-ups, planks, bicep curls, standing posture

### Optional Features

- **Gamification** — points, badges, and streaks for patient engagement
- **Doctor-patient messaging** with real-time notifications
- **Health score trends** with interactive line charts
- **Medication interaction checker** for basic drug conflict warnings
- **Recovery milestones** with visual timeline
- **Health journal** for daily notes and symptom tracking
- **Emergency SOS button** for critical alerts
- **Lab report OCR** for extracting values from uploaded reports
- **Wearable device simulation** for step count and sleep tracking

