## User Roles and Workflows

### Patient Workflow

1. Register with personal and medical details
2. Login to patient dashboard
3. Search for doctors by name or specialization
4. Book an appointment with a doctor
5. Wait for doctor to confirm
6. Once confirmed, open chat with doctor
7. Send text messages or voice messages to doctor
8. Receive real-time replies from doctor
9. Complete daily check-in
10. View recovery plan created by doctor
11. Complete daily recovery tasks
12. Track medicine schedule
13. Upload health records and lab reports
14. Use exercise session with real-time pose feedback
15. Chat with AI assistant about health status
16. View alerts and notifications

### Doctor Workflow

1. Register with medical credentials
2. Login to doctor dashboard
3. View patient list with recovery scores
4. Receive appointment requests
5. Confirm or decline appointments
6. Once appointment confirmed, open chat with patient
7. Receive real-time text and voice messages from patient
8. Reply with text or voice messages
9. Select a patient to view detailed information
10. Create or edit personalized recovery plan
11. Prescribe medicines with dosage and schedule
12. View patient exercise form analysis
13. Monitor patient progress over time

### Caretaker Workflow

1. Register and link to a patient
2. Login to caretaker dashboard
3. View patient vitals, medicines, and tasks (read-only)
4. View upcoming appointments
5. Monitor alerts and notifications

