### Phase 5: Vitals, Alerts, and Dashboard (Days 29-33)

- Add vitals trend endpoint (/api/health-record/:userId/trends)
- Add smart alert generation on vitals submission (check abnormal values)
- Add smart alert generation on medicine status changes
- Add smart alert generation on missed recovery tasks
- Build vitals trend visualization (line charts)
- Build doctor dashboard overview with real statistics
- Split Patient.jsx into separate component files
- Split Doctor.jsx into separate component files
- Create shared components (Layout, Modal, StatCard, AlertBadge)

### Phase 6: AI Features (Days 34-37)

- Build /api/chat/ai endpoint with rule-based responses
- Build AI chat UI component for patient dashboard
- Build AI analysis view for doctor (patient health score and insights)
- Test AI responses for medicine, recovery, vitals, appointment queries

### Phase 7: Daily Check-In and File Upload (Days 38-41)

- Verify existing daily check-in flow works end-to-end
- Fix file upload to use FormData instead of base64
- Verify file download endpoint works
- Build health records page with upload and download functionality
- Add file type validation (PDF, JPG, JPEG, PNG only)

### Phase 8: Real-Time Pose Analysis (Days 42-50)

- Install MediaPipe npm packages (@mediapipe/pose, camera_utils, drawing_utils)
- Add ExerciseSession and ExerciseFrame models to database
- Build pose analysis backend endpoints (/api/pose/analyze, sessions, trends)
- Build PoseCamera.jsx component with webcam integration
