### Phase 9: Gamification and Engagement (Days 51-55)

- Add Achievement, PatientAchievement, PointsLog, PatientLevel models
- Implement points system (check-in, medicine, tasks, exercise, streaks)
- Implement badge system (first check-in, streak master, medicine hero, etc.)
