### Phase 10: Additional Features (Days 56-62)

- Build medication interaction checker (basic drug conflict warnings)
- Build recovery milestones with visual timeline
- Build health journal / symptom diary for patients
- Build doctor availability and slot booking system
- Build emergency SOS button
