### Phase 11: Polish and Testing (Days 63-70)

- Create comprehensive seed data (5 patients, 5 doctors, 30 days history, chat messages)
- Test all end-to-end scenarios for all three roles
- Test real-time chat with audio between patient and doctor
- Test voice message recording and playback
- Verify responsive design on mobile and desktop
- Fix any remaining UI/UX issues
- Verify all API endpoints return correct data
- Test error handling (network failures, invalid inputs)

