## Running the Application

### Start Backend

```bash
cd backend
# Activate virtual environment first
# Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate
# macOS/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate

python app.py
```

Backend runs at http://localhost:5000 (Flask + Socket.IO)

### Start Frontend

```bash
# From project root
npm run dev
```

Frontend runs at http://localhost:5173

### Test Real-Time Chat

1. Open http://localhost:5173 in Chrome (Patient login: rani@gmail.com / 123456)
2. Open http://localhost:5173 in Firefox (Doctor login: ravi@healtrack.ai / doctor123)
3. Patient books appointment with doctor
4. Doctor confirms appointment
5. Both see "Chat" button on the appointment card
6. Both open chat and send messages
7. Messages appear instantly in real-time
8. Patient clicks mic button to record voice message
9. Doctor sees voice message with play button and duration
10. Doctor clicks play to hear the voice message
11. Doctor replies with text or voice

